flowchart TB
    accTitle: Elausys architecture
    accDescr: A single entry point, Nginx Proxy Manager, routes traffic to four React sites, the Express API and a self-hosted Supabase. The API handles the database, e-mails and payments, and hands the CRM sync over to n8n.

    U("Browsers")
    NPM["Nginx Proxy Manager<br/>:80 · :443"]
    SUPA["Self-hosted Supabase<br/>Kong · GoTrue · PostgREST<br/>Storage · Realtime"]
    API["knx-backend<br/>Express · :3000"]
    SITES["4 sites<br/>React + Vite"]
    PG[("PostgreSQL 15")]
    N8N["n8n · :5678"]
    EXT["Outside services<br/>Stripe · Brevo · Axonaut"]

    U --> NPM
    NPM --> SUPA
    NPM --> API
    NPM --> SITES
    SUPA --> PG
    SUPA -. "e-mail hook" .-> API
    API --> PG
    API -->|webhooks| N8N
    API --> EXT
    N8N --> EXT

    class API accent
